messages[10]{user,text}:
  user_2,[00:00] Hello, am I speaking with Mr. Rohan Deshmukh?
  user_1,[00:06] Yeah, speaking. Who is this?
  user_2,[00:08] Hi Rohan, this is Ramesh Tiwari calling from Safe Shield Agency, on behalf of DCoders. Umm, I'm calling regarding your life insurance policy -- your term plan.
  user_1,[00:00:20] Oh, right. Actually, I was meaning to look into that. I got some notification about it recently?
  user_2,[00:00:27] Yes, exactly. [typing] Let me just pull up your file here... Ah, yes. So your policy status is currently showing as pending document verification, and I just wanted to help you get that cleared up today so we can keep it active, you know?
  user_1,[00:00:46] Right, right. I had submitted some bank statements or something last week, but I wasn't sure if it went through properly.
  user_2,[00:00:54] [sighs] Yeah, unfortunately, the previous upload got slightly corrupted on our portal. But don't worry, it's a very quick fix. If you have the PDF handy right now, I can actually guide you or we can verify the details over the call.
  user_1,[00:01:12] Let me check... [rustling sound] Umm, yeah, I think I have it here on my desktop. Desktop folder... hang on a second.
  user_2,[00:01:25] Take your time, no rush at all. We just want to make sure everything's squared away so your coverage remains fully active without any gaps.
  user_1,[00:01:35] Found it. Okay, what do you need me to do?